{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Oh, but before I forget, I think Tsukino wanted to ask a favor of you.": "",
  "Yeah? Shoot.": "",
  "Um... This is hard to ask, but...": "",
  "Don't worry, I can take it.": "",
  "Can you, um... destroy any records of what I told you about my panties? Knowing that's out there is mortifying...": "",
  "Sure, if that'll make you more comfortable.": "",
  "This Panty Professor is probably the first guy to actually see them, huh Tsukino?": "",
  "Didn't I just say I didn't want to think about it!?": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san, just so you know, Tsukino is on the market, and I'd say if <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> wanted to see her panties...": "",
  "Haha, get outta here with that.": "",
  "The Twisted Trio. Let's hope the cops get to deal with the other two...": "",
  "Um... You must be Saotome-san?": "",
  "I'm Yagami, the detective you were asking about.": "",
  "Ah! It's a pleasure to meet you, Yagami-san!": "",
  "(All right, time to head up.)": "",
  "'Scuse me... I don't mean to scare ya, but I need help bad...": "",
  "...What's the matter? Are you hurt?": "",
  "My stomach, it's... killing me all of a sudden... *groan*": "",
  "Should I call an ambulance?": "",
  "No, don't do that... I don't have that kinda money... Please, just go get Moroboshi-sensei...": "",
  "Is he some kind of doctor?": "",
  "Y-Yeah, he should be underground in the sewers... You can get there through a manhole in the Children's Park...": "",
  "All right. Stay put for a minute.": "",
  "He'll understand if you tell him Kondo is asking for him. Please... hurry...": "",
  "(Why would a doctor be hanging around in the sewers? ...Guess that's not what really matters here.)": "",
  "Hey, are you Moroboshi-sensei?": "",
  "...I am. And who might you be?": "",
  "Doesn't ring a bell. So what do you want?": "",
  "(...What was I supposed to tell this guy again?)": "",
  "...Hmm?": "",
  "Oh, wait, that isn't what I meant...": "",
  "No rush. Think about what you're saying here.": "",
  "(Damn. What was I supposed to say again...?)": "",
  "Huh? What do you mean? I'm Moroboshi.": "",
  "There's no need to rush. Just stay calm and be precise.": "",
  "(Crap, I got it wrong. Uhh, what was I supposed to say again...?)": "",
  "There's this homeless guy, goes by Kondo. You know him? He was asking for your help just now.": "",
  "...What? Kondo-san was?": "",
  "Yeah. He said his stomach was killing him.": "",
  "Public Park Three.": "",
  "H-Hey!": "",
  "Whoo... I made it! Thanks a million, doc. You too, my guy.": "",
  "Did you eat something strange again?": "",
  "Uhh, let me think... Well, I did some dumpster diving at Pink Street yesterday. I knew I tasted something fishy!": "",
  "For crying out loud...": "",
  "Hahaha. Oops, looks like Kondo-san's done it again! ♪": "",
  "Yagami-san... wasn't it?": "",
  "Sorry for your trouble. This guy's always eating trash and messing up his stomach.": "",
  "No worries. But I've gotta ask, are you actually a doctor?": "",
  "...Yeah. Or at least, I was. But that's all in the past.": "",
  "Moroboshi-sensei used to be a doctor at this huuuge medical university!": "",
  "But he's been down in the dumps since he lost his chance to become a professor. So he started helping us out instead.": "",
  "...You talk too much, Kondo-san.": "",
  "Oopsie-daisy. My bad.": "",
  "As for you, Yagami-san... Here's something for your trouble. I know it isn't much.": "",
  "I appreciate it either way.": "",
  "Thanks for helping out, Yagami-san! I'll see you around.": "",
  "Ah. Yagami-san. Thanks for the other day.": "",
  "No sweat, Moroboshi-sensei. Good to see you.": "",
  "So... You used to be part of a medical university? What was that like?": "",
  "...That was a long time ago. Thinking back on it now, I can't believe I got swept up in all that bullshit.": "",
  "All I ever thought about was how to get tenured, even at the cost of the people around me. Couldn't trust anyone.": "",
  "After I left the hospital and ended up on the streets, these folks were the only ones who showed me any kind of dignity.": "",
  "They've been taking care of me ever since.": "",
  "Wow... I had no idea.": "",
  "Moroboshi-sensei! Help, we need a doctor!": "",
  "What's wrong, Hamanaka-san?": "",
  "I-It's Kondo-san! He got into an accident!": "",
  "We're bringing him here right now, so can you take a look!?": "",
  "I'm on it!": "",
  "All right. I've done everything I can. But we don't have enough blood for a proper transfusion...": "",
  "...Yagami-san, Hamanaka-san. I have a favor to ask.": "",
  "What is it, Moroboshi-sensei!?": "",
  "We need people who can donate type O blood to Kondo-san... Several of them!": "",
  "Okay! I'll ask around the homeless community!": "",
  "I'm going to ask around the Champion District, so could you take care of Public Park Three?": "",
  "Public Park Three. Got it.": "",
  "All right, I'm counting on you!": "",
  "Excuse me! Is anyone here blood type O?": "",
  "Huh? What's this all of a sudden?": "",
  "This guy named Kondo-san got into an accident and needs a blood transfusion, fast!": "",
  "What did you say!? Kon-chan's hurt!? Are you serious?": "",
  "Yes! So please! Is there anyone with type O blood!?": "",
  "I'm... type O.": "",
  "Great! Now would you please come with me right away?": "",
  "S-Sure. Anything for Kon-chan.": "",
  "Then let's get going!": "",
  "...Alright, that should do it.": "",
  "That was a close one...": "",
  "Moroboshi-sensei, thank you so much!": "",
  "Man, I'm so happy right now.": "",
  "Thanks again, Yagami-san. Sorry to put you out like that.": "",
  "It was no trouble at all.": "",
  "Well, I need to thank you somehow.": "",
  "If you find yourself injured, I'll treat you any time. Stop by whenever medicine alone won't do the trick.": "",
  "You're welcome here anytime.": "",
  "I do have to charge you, of course.": "",
  "Heh. Sounds like just what the doctor ordered.": "",
  "Indeed. Well then. I'll see you around.": "",
  "You need anything, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Could I bother you for a check-up?": "",
  "Treatment's gonna cost you 20,000 yen. I am running a business, after all.": "",
  "I see. Don't push yourself too hard, all right?": "",
  "Your treatment's all finished. Drop by again whenever you feel the need.": "",
  "Hm? Looks like you don't have enough money.": "",
  "I'll see you any time, so come back later.": "",
  "Hold on, you're completely healthy. Enough with the jokes.": "",
  "Drop by again if there's anything else you need.": "",
  "My schedule's always flexible, so come back anytime.": "",
  "Hm? Looks like you can't hold anything else.": "",
  "My schedule's always flexible, so come back once you lighten your load.": "",
  "Aghhh...": "",
  "Hey, that was delicious.": "",
  "Thanks. I noticed you've been here a couple times.": "",
  "Yeah, I try to swing by every so often.": "",
  "Cool. I'm Haoyu Xiu, by the way.": "",
  "...You got yourself a name, partner?": "",
  "You can call me Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami-san, huh? Okay. So, I'm new here in Japan.": "",
  "Ah. Did you just arrive or something?": "",
  "Actually, I've been here for a while now, but it's still all new to me!": "",
  "That makes sense. It does take time to adjust, especially when you're right in the heart of downtown.": "",
  "You got that right! Never thought I'd end up in Kamurocho of all places...": "",
  "I started off listening to Japanese music. I'd look up words I didn't know and study them as much as I could.": "",
  "Next thing I knew, I ended up here... mastering the language that moved my heart.": "",
  "But I still have a long road ahead of me...": "",
  "Well I think you're doing just fine. Take it one step at a time, and I'm sure you'll be all right. Good luck, Xiu.": "",
  "Thank you very much! Please come again!": "",
  "Mmm. That was good.": "",
  "Thanks! Glad you came by.": "",
  "You're Xiu, right? We met the other day. Getting used to Japan yet?": "",
  "Mmm, yes and no. To be honest, I'm finding that Kamurocho's kind of dangerous...": "",
  "Hate to say it, but around these parts, it is. Welcome to the jungle.": "",
  "You know, a woman got shot in the city just the other day...": "",
  "Oh, that sort of stuff only happens once in a blue moon. You'll be okay.": "",
  "I know. Danger won't stop me from liking Japan any less!": "",
  "Though I probably should mention... People do tend to get a bit punchy around here. It happens on the regular.": "",
  "What do you mean by... punchy?": "",
  "Oh, that just means people get into fights all the time.": "",
  "People fight here all the time!? That's... not good!": "",
  "My advice? If you're about to get dragged into something shady, just book it. Oh, and thank you for the meal!": "",
  "Okay then... I'll do that. Hope to see you again soon.": "",
  "Hm? Did something happen just now?": "",
  "Yagami-san...! *gasp* A regular... *pant* g-got punchy...": "",
  "Are you okay? Calm down and tell me what happened.": "",
  "...Had no money. *sigh* Just... booked it!": "",
  "I don't exactly... Uh, what do you mean?": "",
  "(All I understood was \"regular,\" \"punchy,\" \"had no money,\" and \"booked it.\" What's Xiu trying to say here?)": "",
  "After doing your regular boxing regimen, you tried to buy a book to improve your punching, but you didn't have the cash.": "",
  "What are you saying, Yagami-san? That's not even close!": "",
  "(So that wasn't it... What the heck is Xiu trying to tell me?)": "",
  "It almost sounded like you hang out with the bad crowd. The kind who would punch bookworms and take their money.": "",
  "You served some punch to one of your regulars, and since he was a starving author, he decided to write a book about it?": "",
  "Wait a minute. A regular... who had no money... got punchy... and decided to book it...?": "",
  "Are you saying that a regular customer got violent with you because he refused to pay the bill, then took off!?": "",
  "Yes! That guy who just ran outside, he's the one! Hurry, please catch him before he gets away!": "",
  "Gotcha! I'll be back before you know it!": "",
  "That's as far as you go, buddy! Just settle down and we won't have to do this the hard way.": "",
  "Hello? Officer? Yeah, we got an issue here...": "",
  "Excellent work, Yagami-san. You really helped me out of a bind.": "",
  "Hey, no problem.": "",
  "Sometimes I have trouble speaking when I panic. I'm glad you bothered to understand me when no one else would.": "",
  "It wasn't a bother at all. Even if your words didn't reach me initially, your feelings sure did.": "",
  "Heh heh. Yagami-san, you rock!": "",
  "Oh, that's right! I had something to give you. It might not seem that useful at first glance, but take a look anyway.": "",
  "I found it at a used bookstore. I thought it was pretty interesting!": "",
  "\"The Art of Gluttony\"? What is this?": "",
  "I bought this because I thought it would help me study. Wasn't too helpful in the end, but at least I got a kick out of it.": "",
  "I see. Then I appreciate the gesture.": "",
  "Thanks again! Oh, and don't forget to come back for our delicious beef bowls! Akaushimaru's still the best in town!": "",
  "I'll be back for sure.": "",
  "Welcome! Would you like to learn about our music fair today?": "",
  "Sure, why not. What's this all about?": "",
  "So! With every 700 yen purchase you make, you will earn 1 point.": "",
  "Once you get 10 points total, we'll present you with a shiny new record!": "",
  "(Hmm... We do have a record player back at the office...)": "",
  "On top of that, each branch carries a different record, so be sure to check us out all over Kamurocho!": "",
  "Now let's get this music fair poppin'!": "",
  "(So everything I buy at Poppo counts toward a prize? That's not a bad deal.)": "",
  "Thanks for stopping by. With the purchase you've made today, your point total has gone up by <t:get_poppo_point>. ": "",
  "Currently, you have a <t:now_poppo_point=friend_032_kizuna_point>-point total.": "",
  "Gather 10 points and we'll present you with a shiny new record!": "",
  "Thanks for shopping with Poppo! Come again soon!": "",
  "Oh, looks like you've reached 10 points! Congratulations!": "",
  "About time, too.": "",
  "Here's your limited-edition record, sir!": "",
  "Thanks for shopping with Poppo! Please come again soon!": "",
  "Today's the day, old man. Time to pay them dues!": "",
  "Better do what aniki tells you while he's still in a good mood!": "",
  "I-I understand what you want, but... Why don't I let you try our new dessert instead?": "",
  "We don't need your mashed-up old bean shit!": "",
  "Oh yes we do! I love me some traditional desserts!": "",
  "Huh? Aniki?": "",
  "Excellent. Our special bean paste is the pride of our store, so I'd definitely recommend it to anyone who likes sweets.": "",
  "Ah, then I know just what I want...": "",
  "Keep it together, Aniki!": "",
  "(Don't tell me... These fools are harassing Takemitsu <font_kind=yakuza_italic>again</font_kind>?)": "",
  "(...Well, sucks to be him.)": "",
  "Looks like you guys still haven't learned your lesson.": "",
  "Lesson? Wait, aren't you...": "",
  "The guy who kicked your ass? Yep.": "",
  "Aha! I thought something like this might happen, so I brought five of my toughest boys along with me!": "",
  "Now it's time for some sweet, sweet revenge! ...And after that, some actual sweets. Mmm.": "",
  "Wh-Whaaaaaaaat!? How is this possible...": "",
  "Quality over quantity, buddy. No matter how many goons you throw at me, they're still gonna end up lying on the ground.": "",
  "If I were you, I'd take your sweets and get lost.": "",
  "Well... Okay! Maybe I will!": "",
  "Whew... You really did a number on those fellas. Again.": "",
  "Just doing my thing.": "",
  "Might I have your name so I can thank you properly?": "",
  "Sure. I'm Takayuki Yagami.": "",
  "I appreciate your intervention, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'm sorry it's not much, but please take this. It's one of our newest confections.": "",
  "Hey, looks good! Thanks.": "",
  "No, thank you. Let's just hope this doesn't happen again.": "",
  "Seriously. Well, I'll see you around.": "",
  "Alright, today's the day for sure! I'm gettin' that money outta you no matter what!": "",
  "Yeah! We've been lenient on your mochi-makin' ass for far too long!": "",
  "That reminds me... I want some more of that mochi from last time. It was so good, it practically melted in my mouth!": "",
  "Oh, those! I'm glad you enjoyed them. They really are a treat...": "",
  "We do have plenty more available this time around. You can buy as much as you like.": "",
  "Good, good... I'll be taking one of each. Or you know what, I'll just take the whole batch!": "",
  "Aniki, not again!": "",
  "(These guys...)": "",
  "You people really don't give up, huh?": "",
  "Damn straight! You're goin' down today!": "",
  "And would you look at that? I've got ten of my boys with me, so I'll be practically unstoppable!": "",
  "*sigh* ...Well, at least you put more effort into it this time.": "",
  "Gaaaah...": "",
  "For the last time, stop bothering this guy. Do you understand?": "",
  "You know... if you really like my sweets that much, you can just have some. Here, it's on me today.": "",
  "Heh, awright! Nothing beats the taste... of your special sweet bean paste!": "",
  "A-Aniki... Have you completely forgotten our mission?": "",
  "Don't give a damn no more! I decided from here on out, I'm dedicating my life to supporting this shop!": "",
  "Then here you go. Don't eat it all in one bite now.": "",
  "Snatchies! I'll take that, thank you very much. Now let's head back to the office!": "",
  "Yes, sir... Right away, sir...": "",
  "Oh yeah! And make sure to line up here tomorrow and buy me some more of them sweets!": "",
  "Aniki... What are you saying...?": "",
  "Did I stutter!?": "",
  "No, sir... Not at all, sir...": "",
  "(Didn't see that coming. Well, at least he's a fan of this shop now.)": "",
  "Thanks again, Yagami-san. Third time's the charm, as they say.": "",
  "Oddly enough, yeah.": "",
  "Oh... And if you'd like, you can have this as well.": "",
  "I can? Thanks!": "",
  "If it's tasty enough to make a yakuza forget about his protection racket, then it must be something special.": "",
  "Well, there's nothing like dessert to make a quarrel disappear.": "",
  "Guess that's the magic of a traditional Japanese sweets shop.": "",
  "Don't I know it? Ahaha. I really do appreciate your kindness.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "H-Hey!": "เ-เฮ้!",
  "I'm on it!": "รับทราบ!",
  "Hey, no problem.": "ไม่เป็นไรเลย"
 }
}
